@startuml
title State diagram of the system operations of "Process Sale"

[*] --> State

state "State" as State
state "Wait for new sale" as WaitForNewSale
state "Enter items one by one" as EnterItemsOneByOne
state "Move to payment after all items have been added" as MoveToPayment
state "Complete the sale immediately if the customer pays with cash" as CompleteSaleImmediately
state "Verify the payment if the customer chooses to pay by card or check" as VerifyPayment
state "Complete the sale once the payment is approved" as CompleteSaleOnceApproved
state "Return to waiting for the next customer after the payment has been finished" as ReturnToWaiting

State --> WaitForNewSale : [*]

WaitForNewSale --> EnterItemsOneByOne : new sale detected

EnterItemsOneByOne --> MoveToPayment : all items added

MoveToPayment --> CompleteSaleImmediately : cash payment
CompleteSaleImmediately --> ReturnToWaiting : sale completed

MoveToPayment --> VerifyPayment : card or check payment
VerifyPayment --> CompleteSaleOnceApproved : payment approved
CompleteSaleOnceApproved --> ReturnToWaiting : sale completed

ReturnToWaiting --> WaitForNewSale : next customer detected

@enduml
